\section{Periodic boundary conditions}
\label{sec:periodic}
We start our discussion of periodic boundary conditions by providing some numerical evidence in support of our statement earlier that the higher order moments for the kicked-Ising model should be well approximated by rescaled moments of the COE, even though it is the incorrect ensemble. After providing this numerical evidence, we compute the higher order moments analytically by explicitly constructing unimodular eigenvectors of higher order transfer matrices.

