\begin{enumerate}
\item[(a)]
The section $P(\varphi^*\kappa_{f(D)})$ is  continuous and bounded for all $P \in S_l$.
\item[(b)] Let $A$ and $B$ be as in \eqref{eq phi quasi isom}. For all  $\mu>1$, and all $P \in S_l$,  there is a $C_P>0$ such that %all $f \in V(\R)$ and
 for all $y,y' \in Y$,
