Let $\kappa \in \cA_{S, \varphi}(E)^H$. We will show that $f(D) \circ \kappa \in \cA_{S, \varphi}(E)^H$ via estimates away from  the diagonal (Lemma \ref{lem off-diag}) and near the diagonal (Lemma \ref{lem near diag}). The estimates for 
