The next Corollary shows that $ \Phi( C^*(N_1\oplus N_2,T)) \subset N_1 {*}_B N_2\subseteq \BB(\FF) $.
\begin{corollary}\label{cor: image of Phi 1}
    For each $i=1,2$, let $ N_{i,0} $ be a C$^*$-subalgebra of $N_i=\langle M_i,e_B\rangle$ such that $  C^*(M_i,e_B)\subset N_{i,0}\subset N_i  $, then
    $$\Phi( C^*(N_{1,0}\oplus N_{1,0},T)) = N_{1,0} {*}_B N_{2,0}\subseteq \BB(\FF).$$
