Using \eqref{ggstat}, it holds 
$$(\nabla_X\,g)(AY,Z)=(\nabla_{AY}\,g)(Z,X), \quad (\nabla_X\,g)(Y,AZ)=(\nabla_{AZ}\,g)(Y,X).$$
Then, by applying 
