$\nabla^g_\xi\,\xi=0$ and
$g(\nabla^g_X\,\xi, Y)+g(\nabla^g_Y\,\xi, X)=0$.
Further, we have
\begin{eqnarray}\label{wdeta}
 d\eta(X,Y) = (\nabla^g_X\,\eta)(Y) -(\nabla^g_Y\,\eta)X)
