    The vibration testing is carried out for both sinusoidal and random vibration loads. A low-level resonance sinusoidal search is carried out both before and after the vibration tests to validate the performance and workmanship of the assembly. For each axis, low-level, medium-level, and qualification-level vibrations are applied. Similar steps are repeated in the other two axes as well. 
