\section{Text Classification Details}\label{appendix:textclassification}

We fine-tuned a taxonomy-aware multi-label classification model using the HuggingFace Transformers framework. All experiments were conducted on a single NVIDIA Quadro RTX 6000 GPU with 24 GB of memory. The following configurations were used:

\begin{itemize}
    \item \textbf{Model:} mDeberta-v3-base
    \item \textbf{Learning Rate:} 2e-5
    \item \textbf{Batch Size:} 3 
    \item \textbf{Number of Epochs:} 10
    \item \textbf{Weight Decay:} 0.01
    \item \textbf{Evaluation Strategy:} Every epoch
    \item \textbf{Early Stopping:} Enabled, with patience of 3 epochs
    \item \textbf{Random Seed:} 42
\end{itemize}

