As reported in Table~\ref{table:final_acc}, we tested the TC-ResNet8, DS-CNN, and KWT-1 models. The baseline method achieves 96.35\%, 97.13\%, and 97.28\% accuracy, respectively, while ASAP-FE scores 95.43\%, 96.22\%, and 96.48\%, representing an overall drop of under 1\%. 
