{We define the \emph{one-point event scenario} $\ast\colon \catC_{\Delta^0} \to \catSet$ by sending the unique object to the singleton set.}


\begin{pro}
$(\catEScen,\otimes,\ast)$ is a symmetric monoidal category.
%, where $\ast$ is the functor from $\catC_{\Delta^0}$ to $\catSet$ with the one-element set as it's image.
