We now define the empirical model $p \in \Emp(F_1 \otimes F_2)$ as follows:
\begin{equation}\label{eq:pDef1}
p_{\set{a_1,b_1} \times \set{a_2,b_2}}(i_1,j_1,i_2,j_2) = \begin{cases}
