Commercial-off-the-shelf (COTS), Linux operating system, Operating system reliability, Raspberry Pi, RISC-V Processor, Single event functional interrupt (SEFI), Single event upset (SEU), Soft errors, Space OS, System-on-chip (SoC)
\end{IEEEkeywords}

