\noindent {\bf Conventions.} Throughout $k$ is a field. We assume rings are commutative and unital, and algebras are associative (unless stated otherwise). Also, for us $\NN=\{1,2,\dots\}$ while $\NN_0=\NN\cup\{0\}$. 















