$$\Lambda_i^e=(r_i^e\otimes \operatorname{Id})\, \circ \, r$$
We further assume the following associativity-type relation
$$\beta_0(\Lambda_i^e)=\beta_1(\Lambda_i^e)$$
where the $\beta_i$'s are defined as above.
